    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> (which needs to be\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>). The lookup will produce a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException</code></a> in case multiple\nbeans of the given type are available in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> 类型在给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>（必须是\n一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>）中的唯一 Bean 的 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a>。如果在给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中存在多个给定类型的 Bean，则查找将产生一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> (which needs to be\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>).",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a>，用于从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>（该工厂需要是一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>）中获取给定类型的唯一 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple helper to allow lenient lookup of beans of a given type from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>. This is not user\nfacing API but a mere helper for Spring Data configuration code.",
      "translation": "一个简单的辅助工具，允许以宽松的方式从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a> 中查找给定类型的 Bean。这不是面向用户的 API，而仅仅是 Spring Data 配置代码的辅助工具。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
