    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>beanFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> to look up the bean from.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>Lazy</code></a> for the unique bean of the given type or the instance provided by the fallback in case no\n        bean of the given type can be found.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>beanFactory</code> - 用于从该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 查找 bean 的实例。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个 <a href=\"Lazy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的类\"><code>Lazy</code></a>，用于获取给定类型的唯一 bean；如果找不到该类型的 bean，则返回 fallback 提供的实例。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
